<title>LITHUANIA: TABLE-Lithuanian Q1 GDP rises 2.4 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Lithuanian Q1 GDP rises 2.4 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lithuania's gross domestic product rose by 2.4 percent in the first quarter of the year on a year-on-year basis, the statistics department said on Wednesday.</p>
<p> LITHUANIAN GDP	    Q1 1997     Q4 1996     Q1 1996</p>
<p> Change yr/yr (pct)	2.4	   3.6	   5.5</p>
<p> GDP (billions of litas) 8.154	 8.598	 6.463</p>
<p>NOTE - The percentage changes are calculated under constant 1993 prices while the amount of gross domestic product is in current prices, which do not strip out inflation.</p>
<p>-- Vilnius newsroom + 370 2 22 35 18</p>
